es. We can use tools directly. Need maybe candidate.json saving. Could maybe use compile tool only, and final output. Later maybe attempt writing candidate.json with shell; read-only will reject. Perhaps tool write not available. The MCP tools may have side effects but no save. Let's not inspect. We can perhaps use shell with `Set-Content` even though sandbox read-only; permission says commands rejected if sandbox_permissions provided, but default read-only. Could `Set-Content` fail. We could try after. But first compile.\n\nNeed know compile tool schema supports `supporting_objects`. Good.\n\nLet's call compile.","sequence_number":1286}

